      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/9\n\n- **Status:** ingame\n- **Release:** v0.1.8 (local test build, commit `ee0652347`)\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite\n- **Driver:** Turnip gen8 v3 (Mesa 26.3.0-devel, build 9c475fc)\n- **Evidence commit:** `c6adb9ec192485741ec21420dea5b21a7f36f78a`\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![Dragon's Crown Pro — v0.1.8 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/c6adb9ec192485741ec21420dea5b21a7f36f78a/assets/CUSA10454/20260814T102802Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![Dragon's Crown Pro — v0.1.8 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/c6adb9ec192485741ec21420dea5b21a7f36f78a/assets/CUSA10454/20260814T102802Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/02.webp)\n\n![Dragon's Crown Pro — v0.1.8 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/c6adb9ec192485741ec21420dea5b21a7f36f78a/assets/CUSA10454/20260814T102802Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/03.webp)\n",
